WEBVTT

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:24.260
I'm going to tell Karyl and Yuuki

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.920
that I'm Eustiana.

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:44.380
What are you doing?

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:47.880
It...

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:51.510
It's time for breakfast!

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:54.750
Don't hang off me first thing in the morning!

00:00:56.030 --> 00:01:00.660
<b></b>Menu 9 <b> Converging Hearts, Passing Souls </b>
~Crepes the Flavor of a Promise~

00:01:01.550 --> 00:01:04.370
Miss Karyl seems to be in a cheerful mood.

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:05.690
Kokkoro...

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:09.160
You're nervous, aren't you?

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:14.660
It's done!

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:16.400
Are you going out?

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:17.650
Yeah, for a bit.

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:20.220
I'll be back by this afternoon!

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.880
T-Take care!

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.650
I see... He's already...

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:54.110
Your Majesty, today I've brought you this...

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:58.560
F-F-F-F-F-Forgive me, Your Majesty!

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:01.690
You seemed to be sleeping 
so fitfully, I just...

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:04.780
No matter.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.850
Um, Your Majesty...

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:17.040
I made rice balls.

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:21.930
I'm sorry for overstepping!

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:29.480
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:35.620
Let's eat a meal together.

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:39.760
Karyl.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:40.740
Yes?!

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.860
I've changed my mind.

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:51.310
H-H-H-Help yourself, Your Majesty!

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:52.570
They're really good!

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:55.670
We harvested and polished 
the rice ourselves!

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:58.650
Then I cooked them with extreme care 
and put in big chunks of filling!

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:02.510
Oh! And I just cooked them this morning, 
so they should still be warm!

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:05.130
I-I'm sorry.

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:16.950
What's inside? Pickled plums?

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:19.430
Oh, um... No, it's dried bonito.

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:22.070
I thought maybe you didn't like sour foods.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:25.200
Wait, what made me think that?

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.560
But pickled plums are tasty, 
so there's one of those, too!

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:35.460
I'll stick with this one.

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:37.480
Karyl...

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.670
Eat with me.

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:53.970
What? You strange girl.

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:58.550
Wow. I think working so hard to harvest 
this rice really was worth it.

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:04.080
You really are a strange girl.

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:21.790
What do you suppose our king is thinking,

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:24.620
deep in that castle of his?

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:29.180
I can't believe there is a part of 
this castle I didn't know about.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:33.510
This is a nation of humans,

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:38.010
so how is it that we have a 
beast sitting on the throne?

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:42.490
Why did I never question that before now?

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:45.050
It's as if my memories...

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:05.460
What in the world...

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:07.300
is this?

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:28.300
Your Majesty... Just who are you?!

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:34.340
A festival?

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.230
Exactly!

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:38.000
At our shopping district!

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:41.050
It's a small festival, but we 
could all have fun together!

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:44.340
A festival! That sounds great! I'm so excited!

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.470
It starts today, so bring the whole gang!

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:49.360
It's gonna be a blast!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.800
<b>PriConne</b>

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:52.390
We'll be there!

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:01.640
Karyl!

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:03.570
There you are!

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:05.310
What're you all doing here?

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:07.870
A festival! There's a festival!

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:09.480
Huh? What are you—

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:12.950
Come on, hurry! They'll run 
out of candied apples!

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:14.070
Wait! No!

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:18.460
I never said I wanted to go! You dummy!

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:18.450
<b>PriConne</b>

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:24.580
Ah, I'm glad you're all here.

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:26.110
Hope you have a good time.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:27.350
Yasuko!

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:29.370
Quite a crowd, isn't it?

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:30.810
It sure is.

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:34.750
Some shops from outside our shopping 
district have stalls open, too.

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:37.000
Oh! Little brother!

00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:39.800
No way! Why are you here?

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:41.170
Oh, no! Is it fate?!

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.950
Did you get bigger since 
the last time I saw you?

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:46.440
You're making your big sister's heart race!

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:47.720
Miss Shizuru.

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:50.470
Oh, hi there, everyone!

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:53.200
Our crepe stand is set up here today.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:56.650
Oh, that's right! Little brother,
 we have a new flavor!

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:57.990
You gotta come try it!

00:07:57.990 --> 00:07:59.500
<b>PriConne</b>

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:02.540
B-B-B-Big... Big brother!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.290
What a blast out of the blue!

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:12.530
Rino, I think you mean 
"a bolt out of the blue."

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:14.010
Welcome.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:20.130
Hi.

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:21.950
Oh, Master!

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:25.170
I wanted my little brother 
to try our new flavor.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:28.270
Good idea. Better fry him 
up a tasty one, then.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.850
Okay, Master!

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:39.760
What do you think of our new flavor?

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:41.320
It's good.

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:43.080
Glad to hear it.

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:48.730
And how are you physically?

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:51.780
I'm okay.

00:08:57.770 --> 00:08:59.060
Really, I'm fine.

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.260
There you are!

00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:04.050
My lord!

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:07.930
Look! We bought lots of snacks!

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:11.990
All of them...

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:16.990
And the bond we have... 
I'll protect them this time.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:22.960
I'm sure you will.

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:26.860
Look at you! You've got cream on your mouth!

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:28.020
What are you, a child?

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:30.620
The child who eats well, grows well!

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:33.330
Here, have some takoyaki 
before it gets cold!

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:34.430
Hot!

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:38.590
You dummy. You have to let 
those cool—ow, hot!

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:39.540
I'm so sorry!

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:41.040
I'll make it easier to eat.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.320
Let me help!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:15.670
I changed the surroundings 
a bit so we can talk, Mana.

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.190
How long has it been?

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:26.810
No good at all.

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.550
Let me see that.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:32.990
You want that stuffed toy, right? So...

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:36.650
Now, listen.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:39.990
In a game like this, 
every target has its own quirks.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:43.150
So, the first thing you have to do 
is locate its center of gravity.

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:45.820
My lord.

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:49.530
There are balloons floating 
on the water over there.

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:50.660
Neat!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:53.540
Don't get lost!

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:55.080
Okay!

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:04.180
Hasta la vista.

00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:13.380
I wasn't at the top of my game today.

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:15.780
But the free candy we got 
for playing is yummy!

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:19.270
Yeah, yeah.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:47.930
Y-You know... I—

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.450
It's such a nice day.

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:51.800
I wish...

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:56.300
I wish this could last forever.

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.210
Yeah.

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:52.490
Were you really foolish enough 
to come in here alone?

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:56.100
I realize it's not like me,

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.890
Omniscient Kaiser.

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:03.950
But time is short... for you and me both.

00:13:07.130 --> 00:13:09.370
As another member of the Seven Crowns,

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:12.780
I feel I'm partially to blame 
for the situation we're in.

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:15.170
So, this time...

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:24.450
I decided I want to stop you.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:31.200
Aren't we in this situation
 because you couldn't do that?

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:44.500
The power you have that lets you freely 
create any object in the world...

00:14:45.850 --> 00:14:47.360
I want it.

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:55.120
Just like this...

00:14:58.340 --> 00:15:00.300
Metamorregnant...

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:12.290
King Leap. Regina Gaes.

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:14.260
Metamorregnant.

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:18.730
No matter how many of the 
Seven Crowns come together,

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:20.930
you are still no match for me...

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:24.150
For Omniscient Kaiser.

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:31.570
Maybe not for who you've been up until now.

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:37.760
You've been making a big show 
of using Metamorregnant's power,

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:40.190
but what about your own power?

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:42.030
Aren't you going to use...

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:46.260
your inherent ability, Hadou Tensei?

00:17:49.350 --> 00:17:50.400
You...

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:54.030
You <i>can't</i> use it, can you?

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:58.810
Since you've been through the Re:Dive 
so many times, just like the boy,

00:17:58.810 --> 00:18:00.580
changes are inevitable.

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:08.310
You fired off too many consecutive 
large-scale techniques.

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:09.930
You've exhausted your magic.

00:18:10.290 --> 00:18:13.440
Impossible! How can I be out of magic?

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:15.480
Where are my Shadows?

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:17.950
I was forced to take measures.

00:18:29.490 --> 00:18:31.560
Arrow Rain!

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:43.340
Sacred...

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:46.140
Punish!

00:18:48.150 --> 00:18:53.720
My guildmates are holding the Shadows, 
the source of your magic, at bay.

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:58.520
It was in another timeline 
that I noticed a change.

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:02.490
Remember when you got us all 
together and tried to kill us?

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:06.240
Even though you have Hadou Tensei, 
which allows you to predict the future,

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:09.720
something unexpected happened 
to you and you fell asleep.

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:11.600
Why?

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:17.060
It's been broken ever since then, hasn't it?

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:21.190
Is that why you gathered the Shadows 
as a temporary source of power

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:22.520
and continued to struggle...

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:24.590
alone?

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.250
Checkmate.

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:37.700
I wish...

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:42.160
I wish this could last forever.

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:03.460
Karyl, listen...

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:08.310
Karyl?

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:14.760
No!

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:26.400
All of them...

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:31.510
And the bond we have... 
I'll protect them this time.

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:34.070
I'm sorry...

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:39.780
for putting your precious friend 
through such terrible pain.

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:46.740
That's a nice picture.

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:52.500
I just hope...

00:21:55.050 --> 00:22:04.110
I just hope all of you will 
remain as you were back then...

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:40.050
Menu 10 <b> Landosol at Sundown</b>
